// Steam Input layout for Lunduke City 2 (gamepads).
// Gamepad emulation: Steam hands the game an Xbox-style pad, and the
// game reads it through SDL as it reads any pad. The bindings mirror
// the factory pad buttons in src/bindings.hpp (factory_pad) and the
// stick, trigger and D-pad handling in src/shell.cpp. See
// packaging/steam/README.md. tests/steam_input_test.py checks it.
